---
title: "publishRaisedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: caller check
    q_check_auth --> q_check_refund: caller is legionOperator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_refund --> q_publish: hasEnded == true AND block.timestamp > refundEndTime
    q_check_refund --> q_revert_timing: refund period not expired
    q_revert_timing --> [*]: revert RefundPeriodActive
    q_publish --> [*]: set totalRaisedCapital, emit RaisedCapitalPublished

    note right of q_publish
        INV-001: publishRaisedCapital only callable after refund period expires
        INV-002: totalRaisedCapital reflects post-refund accepted amount
    end note
